   <item><layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="headingLayout"><property name="spacing"><number>4</number></property>
    <item><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="headingTitleLayout"><item><widget class="QLabel" name="headingLabel"><property name="text"><string>高级调整中心</string></property><property name="pageHeading" stdset="0"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item><widget class="infobutton" name="headingInfoButton"><property name="toolTip"><string>高级调整会影响多名学生或多间宿舍。系统会先生成预览，确认后再统一核对并执行。</string></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="headingSpacer"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Orientation::Horizontal</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>20</width><height>20</height></size></property></spacer></item></layout></item>
    <item><widget class="QLabel" name="headingDescriptionLabel"><property name="text"><string>批量操作会先核对住宿信息并展示影响范围；发现学生记录与实际床位不一致时不会执行。</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="pageDescription" stdset="0"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item>
   </layout></item>
   <item><layout class="QHBoxLayout" name="cardLayout" stretch="1,1,1"><property name="spacing"><number>14</number></property>
    <item><widget class="QFrame" name="batchAssignmentCard"><property name="advancedCard" stdset="0"><bool>true</bool></property><layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="batchAssignmentLayout"><property name="spacing"><number>10</number></property><item><widget class="QLabel" name="batchAssignmentTitle"><property name="text"><string>批量住宿分配</string></property><property name="detailHeading" stdset="0"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QLabel" name="batchAssignmentDescription"><property name="text"><string>为当前未入住学生补分床位，或在完整快照保护下重新安排全校住宿。</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property><property name="pageDescription" stdset="0"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item><widget class="QLabel" name="batchAssignmentSummary"><property name="text"><string>未入住学生：0 人</string></property><property name="detailSubheading" stdset="0"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item><item><spacer name="batchSpacer"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Orientation::Vertical</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>20</width><height>40</height></size></property></spacer></item><item><widget class="QPushButton" name="batchAssignmentButton"><property name="text"><string>开始安排</string></property><property name="primaryButton" stdset="0"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item></layout></widget></item>
